msgstr "过采样"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters.json:1500
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:ADC · /properties/parameters/properties/additional/properties/ovs_panel/properties/scope/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Oversampling scope: ADC groups regular and/or injected.\n"
"If ADC group injected conversion insertion within regular sequence:\n"
"- setting continued: when group injected is triggered, the oversampling on group regular is "
"temporary stopped and continued afterwards.\n"
"- setting resumed: when group injected is triggered, the oversampling on group regular is resumed "
"from start (oversampler buffer reset). This device supports parallel injected oversampling, "
"allowing to perform oversampling on groups regular and injected independently (different "
"accumulators with their own settings ratio and shift), refer to panel 'Oversampling group injected'."
msgstr ""
"过采样范围：ADC 常规组和/或注入组。\n"
"若在常规序列中插入 ADC 注入组转换：\n"
"- 设置为继续：当触发注入组时，常规组上的过采样会暂停并在之后继续。\n"
"- 设置为重置恢复：当触发注入组时，常规组上的过采样从头重新开始（过采样器缓冲区重置）。该器件支持并行注入过采样，允许独立对常规组和注入组执行过采样（各自使用不同累加器及其倍率和移位设置），请参阅面板“注入组过采样”。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters.json:1508
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:ADC · /properties/parameters/properties/additional/properties/ovs_panel/properties/scope/oneOf/1/title
#, config-value
msgid "Regular (continued)"
msgstr "常规（继续）"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters.json:1510
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:ADC · /properties/parameters/properties/additional/properties/ovs_panel/properties/scope/oneOf/1/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"ADC oversampling on conversions of ADC group regular. If ADC group injected conversion insertion "
"within regular sequence: oversampling on group regular is temporary stopped and, after injected "
"conversion, continued (oversampling accumulator maintained)."
msgstr "对 ADC 常规组的转换进行 ADC 过采样。若在常规序列中插入 ADC 注入组转换：常规组上的过采样会暂停，并在注入转换后继续（保留过采样累加器）。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters.json:1513
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:ADC · /properties/parameters/properties/additional/properties/ovs_panel/properties/scope/oneOf/2/title
#, config-value
msgid "Regular (resumed)"
msgstr "常规（重置恢复）"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters.json:1515
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:ADC · /properties/parameters/properties/additional/properties/ovs_panel/properties/scope/oneOf/2/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"ADC oversampling on conversions of ADC group regular. If ADC group injected conversion insertion "
"within regular sequence: after injected conversion, oversampling on group regular is resumed from "
"start (oversampler accumulator reset)."
msgstr "对 ADC 常规组的转换进行 ADC 过采样。若在常规序列中插入 ADC 注入组转换：在注入转换后，常规组上的过采样从头重新开始（过采样累加器重置）。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters.json:1520
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_adc_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:ADC · /properties/parameters/properties/additional/properties/ovs_panel/properties/scope/oneOf/3/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"ADC oversampling on conversions of ADC group injected, in sequential mode: oversampling conversions "
"sequence sequential, switching data registers after each oversampling process (all ratio "
"occurrences, shift)."
msgstr "顺序模式下对 ADC 注入组转换的 ADC 过采样：按顺序执行过采样转换序列，在每个过采样过程（所有倍率出现次数、移位）后切换数据寄存器。"

