#, config-value
msgid ""
"'The header is used for authentication, is structured as a sequence of message blocks. The first "
"block, B1, is composed of the associated data length and the first part of Associated Data, must be "
"in hexadecimal format.'"
msgstr "报头用于身份验证，结构为一系列消息块。第一个块 B1 由关联数据长度和关联数据的第一部分组成，必须为十六进制格式。"

