"'The header, also known as additional Authentication Data in GCM mode is used as first part of the "
"message just after the Initial Counter Block (ICB), and precede the plain text message, must be in "
"hexadecimal format.'"
msgstr "报头在 GCM 模式下也称为附加身份验证数据，紧接在初始计数器块（ICB）之后用作消息的第一部分，并位于纯文本消息之前，必须为十六进制格式。"

