#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:CORTEX MPU · /properties/parameters/properties/info/properties/note/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"MPU default configuration:\n"
"\n"
"Because the instruction cache is enabled, the MPU must be enabled with the OTP/RO data area defined "
"as a non-cacheable read-only region (0x08FF FE00-0x08FF FFFF range cover the full area) if the "
"region is effectively used."
msgstr ""
"MPU 默认配置：\n"
"\n"
"由于启用了指令缓存，如果实际使用了 OTP/RO 数据区，则必须启用 MPU 并将该区域定义为不可缓存的只读区域（0x08FF FE00-0x08FF FFFF 范围覆盖全部区域）。"

