#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:CORTEX MPU · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/default_map_enabled/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Enable the default MPU memory configuration. If an address is not covered by any MPU region is "
"accessed with this option enabled the base memory mapping applies. If the option is disabled, any "
"memory access not covered by an MPU region triggers a memory management fault."
msgstr ""
"启用默认 MPU 存储器配置。若在此选项启用的情况下访问未被任何 MPU 区域覆盖的地址，则应用基本存储器映射。若禁用该选项，则访问未被 MPU 区域覆盖的任何存储器都将触发存储器管理故障。"

