msgid "DMA double data mode"
msgstr "DMA 双数据模式"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_dac_parameters.json:690
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_dac_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32 MX Config:DAC · /properties/parameters/properties/channels/items/properties/additional/properties/dma/properties/double_data_mode/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"DMA double data mode allow the application to efficiently use the bus bandwidth. When the DMA "
"controller is used in normal mode, only 12-bit (or 8-bit) data are transferred by a DMA request. As "
"the AHB width is 32 bits, two 12-bit data may be transferred simultaneously. In DMA double data "
"mode, a DAC DMA request is generated every two external triggers."
msgstr ""
"DMA 双数据模式允许应用程序高效利用总线带宽。当 DMA 控制器用于普通模式时，每个 DMA 请求仅传输 12 位（或 8 位）数据。由于 AHB 位宽为 32 位，因此可同时传输两个 12 "
"位数据。在 DMA 双数据模式下，每两个外部触发就会生成一个 DAC DMA 请求。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_dac_parameters.json:695
