#, config-value
msgid "DMA double data mode is only available when DMA is enabled for the channel."
msgstr "DMA 双数据模式仅在为该通道启用 DMA 时可用。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_dac_parameters.json:710
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_dac_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32 MX Config:DAC · /properties/parameters/properties/channels/items/properties/additional/properties/sample_and_hold/title
#, config-value
