#, config-value
msgid ""
"The DAC core converts data and then holds the converted voltage on a capacitor. When not "
"converting, the DAC cores and buffer are completely turned off, therefore reducing the overall "
"power consumption."
msgstr "DAC 内核转换数据，然后将转换后的电压保持在电容器上。在不进行转换时，DAC 内核和缓冲区完全关闭，从而降低总体功耗。"

