#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:3966
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/title
#. 共 2 处使用
#, config-value
msgid "Clock calibration unit"
msgstr "时钟校准单元"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2075
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Configure the FDCAN Clock Calibration Unit (CCU). When the clock is routed through the CCU, FDCAN1 "
"measures the timing of a reference CAN frame and the CCU calibrates the time-quanta clock for all "
"FDCAN instances.\n"
"In BYPASS mode the CCU can still be used to monitor calibration state and timing counters, but it "
"does not influence the FDCAN clock and bit timings."
msgstr ""
"配置 FDCAN 时钟校准单元（CCU）。当时钟通过 CCU 路由时，FDCAN1 测量参考 CAN 帧的时序，且 CCU 为所有 FDCAN 实例校准时间片时钟。\n在旁路（BYPASS）模式下，CCU 仍可用于监控校准状态和时序计数器，但它不会影响 FDCAN 时钟和位定时。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2091
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/clock_calibration_enable
#, config-value
msgid ""
"In bypass mode, use the CCU to measure and report calibration status (monitoring) while the "
"application keeps full control of the FDCAN1 instance bit timing.\n"
" In calibration mode, use the CCU to perform hardware calibration."
msgstr ""
"在旁路模式下，使用 CCU 测量并报告校准状态（监控），同时应用程序保持对 FDCAN1 实例位定时的完全控制。\n"
"在校准模式下，使用 CCU 执行硬件校准。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2103
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/clock_calibration_enable
#, config-value
msgid ""
"At least one calibration type filter must be configured to treat Rx buffer messages as calibration "
"messages."
msgstr "必须配置至少一个校准类型的过滤器，以便将 Rx 缓冲区消息作为校准消息处理。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2108
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/clock_calibration_enable
#, config-value
msgid ""
"When using the Clock Calibration Unit (CCU) for a software-driven calibration sequence, all FDCAN "
"instances must be configured in restricted operation mode.\n"
"This requirement does not apply when the CCU is used only to monitor calibration status."
msgstr ""
"当使用时钟校准单元（CCU）进行软件驱动的校准序列时，所有 FDCAN 实例必须配置为受限运行模式。\n"
"当 CCU 仅用于监控校准状态时，此要求不适用。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2121
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/time_quanta_per_bit_time
#, config-value
msgid "Time quanta per bit time"
msgstr "每位时间的时间片"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2123
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/time_quanta_per_bit_time
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Total number of small time steps that make up one CAN bit when the clock calibration unit (CCU) is "
"used.\n"
"This value is automatically set from FDCAN1 nominal timing (\"nominal Time segment 1\" + \"nominal "
"Time segment 2\" + 1) so that the clock calibration unit and the FDCAN bit timing stay consistent."
msgstr ""
"使用时钟校准单元（CCU）时构成一个 CAN 位的小时间步长总数。\n"
"此值会根据 FDCAN1 标称定时（“标称时间段 1” + “标称时间段 2” + 1）自动设置，以使时钟校准单元与 FDCAN 位定时保持一致。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2148
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/calibration_field_length
#, config-value
msgid "Calibration field length"
msgstr "校准字段长度"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2149
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/calibration_field_length
#, config-value
msgid "Length of the calibration field in bits."
msgstr "校准字段的长度（以位为单位）。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2154
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/calibration_field_length
#, config-value
msgid "32 bits (faster/less accurate)"
msgstr "32 位（更快/精度较低）"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2158
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/calibration_field_length
#, config-value
msgid "64 bits (slower/more accurate)"
msgstr "64 位（较慢/精度较高）"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2166
#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2182
#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2199
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/calibration_field_length
#. 共 3 处使用
#, config-value
msgid ""
"This field is not configurable when the CCU is not used (neither for calibration nor for "
"monitoring)."
msgstr "当未使用 CCU 时（既不用于校准也不用于监控），此字段不可配置。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2172
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/min_osc_clk_periods/titl
#, config-value
msgid "Minimum oscillator clock periods"
msgstr "最小振荡器时钟周期数"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters.json:2173
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_fdcan_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:FDCAN · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/timings/properties/clock_calibration/properties/min_osc_clk_periods/desc
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Glitch filter for basic calibration: minimum number of oscillator clock periods (OCPM x 32) "
"accepted as \"two bit times\" between falling edges on RX. It should be set slightly below two "
