#. 语境：::Device:STM32 MX Config:OPAMP · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/config/properties/external_mode/oneOf/2/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Non-inverting PGA with external bias, or inverting PGA: Inverting input connected to the internal "
"feedback resistor. VINM0 is available for bias voltage in Non-inverting mode or to use the OPAMP in "
"inverting mode. Negative gain (Inverting mode): VINPx: Bias voltage, VINM0: Input signal. Positive "
"gain (Non-inverting mode): VINPx: Input signal, VINM0: Bias voltage."
msgstr ""
"带外部偏置的同相 PGA 或反相 PGA：反相输入连接到内部反馈电阻。VINM0 可在同相模式下用作偏置电压，或在反相模式下使用 "
"OPAMP。负增益（反相模式）：VINPx：偏置电压，VINM0：输入信号。正增益（同相模式）：VINPx：输入信号，VINM0：偏置电压。"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_opamp_parameters.json:153
#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_opamp_parameters.json:555
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_opamp_parameters
