msgstr "同相或反相 + 偏置和滤波"

#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_opamp_parameters.json:154
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_opamp_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32 MX Config:OPAMP · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/config/properties/external_mode/oneOf/3/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"Inverting or non-inverting PGA with external bias and/or filtering: In PGA mode, the inverting "
"input is connected to the internal feedback resistor and to VINM1 for filtering. VINM0 is available "
"for bias voltage in Non-inverting mode or to use the OPAMP in inverting mode. Negative gain "
"(Inverting mode): VINPx: Bias voltage,  VINM0: Input signal, VINM1 - VOUT: Additional low-pass "
"filtering. Positive gain (Non-inverting mode): VINPx: Input signal, VINM0: Bias voltage, VINM1 - "
"VOUT: Additional low-pass filtering."
msgstr ""
"带外部偏置和/或滤波的反相或同相 PGA：在 PGA 模式下，反相输入连接到内部反馈电阻并连接到 VINM1 以进行滤波。VINM0 可在同相模式下用作偏置电压，或在反相模式下使用 "
"OPAMP。负增益（反相模式）：VINPx：偏置电压，VINM0：输入信号，VINM1 - VOUT：额外低通滤波。正增益（同相模式）：VINPx：输入信号，VINM0：偏置电压，VINM1 - "
"VOUT：额外低通滤波。"

