#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:PCD · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/pma_settings/items/properties/number/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"The endpoint number and its direction allow to compute the endpoint address. The direction is "
"encoded in bit 7 of the address: 0x80 indicates an IN endpoint (device-to-host), while 0x00 "
"indicates an OUT endpoint (host-to-device). Therefore, the endpoint address is (endpoint_number & "
"0x0F) | 0x80 for IN endpoints, and (endpoint_number & 0x0F) for OUT endpoints. For example, "
"endpoint 3 IN is 0x83, and endpoint 3 OUT is 0x03."
msgstr ""
"端点编号及其方向可用于计算端点地址。方向编码在地址的第 7 位中：0x80 表示 IN 端点（设备到主机），而 0x00 表示 OUT 端点（主机到设备）。因此，IN 端点的端点地址为 "
"(endpoint_number & 0x0F) | 0x80，OUT 端点的端点地址为 (endpoint_number & 0x0F)。例如，端点 3 IN 为 0x83，端点 3 OUT 为 "
"0x03。"

