# 译者: independent-timer-review-2026-09-14
#: pack-config/stm32c5xx_tim_parameters.json:1115
#. 界面位置：pack-config/stm32c5xx_tim_parameters
#. 语境：::Device:STM32CubeMX2 Config:TIM · /properties/parameters/properties/basic/properties/sampling_clock/properties/clock_division/description
#, config-value
msgid ""
"The prescaler sets the division ratio between the timer kernel clock (tim_ker_ck) and the DTS clock "
"(DTS_ck). The DTS clock is used, when supported, by the dead-time generator, the break/break2 "
"filters and internal digital filters (tim_etr_in, tim_tix)."
msgstr ""
"预分频器设置定时器内核时钟（tim_ker_ck）与 DTS 时钟（DTS_ck）的分频比。在硬件支持时，DTS 时钟用于死区发生器、刹车/刹车 2 "
"滤波器及内部数字滤波器（tim_etr_in、tim_tix）。"

# 译者: independent-timer-review-2026-09-14
